```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-admin-basic-info-service",
      "fault_kind": "application_method_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'abn' p, span_name, COUNT(*) n, ROUND(AVG(duration)/1e6,1) avg_ms, ROUND(quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-admin-basic-info-service' AND span_name='AdminBasicInfoController.getAllContacts' GROUP BY 1,2 UNION ALL SELECT 'norm', span_name, COUNT(*), ROUND(AVG(duration)/1e6,1), ROUND(quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-admin-basic-info-service' AND span_name='AdminBasicInfoController.getAllContacts' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "getAllContacts self-time rose from about 8 ms (normal p95 ~9 ms) to about 1718 ms (abnormal p95 ~1719 ms), with no errors."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'abn' p, c.service_name, c.span_name, c.attr_span_kind, COUNT(*) n, ROUND(AVG(c.duration)/1e6,1) avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.span_name='AdminBasicInfoController.getAllContacts' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4",
          "claim": "getAllContacts's only child is a ~5 ms client GET, so the extra time is spent inside the method, not in a DB or downstream call."
        },
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT metric, ROUND(AVG(value),3) av FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-admin-basic-info-service' AND metric IN ('container.cpu.usage','k8s.pod.cpu_limit_utilization','k8s.pod.memory_limit_utilization','container.memory.working_set') GROUP BY 1",
          "claim": "CPU and memory of ts-admin-basic-info-service stay low and flat during the incident, so no resource saturation explains the slowdown."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-admin-basic-info-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT p.service_name AS caller, c.service_name AS callee, c.span_name, COUNT(*) n, ROUND(AVG(c.duration)/1e6,1) avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE c.service_name='ts-admin-basic-info-service' AND c.span_name LIKE '%adminbasic/contacts%' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "The user-facing ts-ui-dashboard calls to /adminbasic/contacts take about 1720 ms, the same slowdown as the callee's getAllContacts."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

